<title>USA: Playtex Products Inc Q4 shr profit vs loss.</title>
<headline>Playtex Products Inc Q4 shr profit vs loss.</headline>
<dateline>WESTPORT, Conn. 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr profit	$0.03	 loss     $0.26</p>
<p> Net profit	1,321	 loss     12,988</p>
<p> Revs		106,303		  103,443</p>
